uto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1738658995/50r1_bba2253e-fdf7-4a15-8aaf-0e848e463660.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":23,"rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z"},{"id":4510043,"path":"https://res-5.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1738658973/50r1_78551faf-77cf-4f74-87e7-151f62107aeb.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":24,"rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z"},{"id":4510045,"path":"https://res-1.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1738659004/50r1_202ab9da-8075-47d6-a088-0e8048858518.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":25,"rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z"}],"image":{"id":4502289,"path":"https://res-4.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1737967800/50r1_473cc888-8a38-4e81-b1e9-7b0f0031f155.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5537541,"review":"The place was clean and as advertised, the location is a bit far from the marina and downtown so you have to take your car\nWe faced a little issue with the QR code at gouna gates but it was resolved within the hour","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5556111,"review":"Very nice view Very clean unit","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5563947,"review":"Besides a delayed check-in we had a great stay, the place was clean and the location is great overlooking the beautiful pool, very private and quiet location, would definitely go again.","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5577025,"review":"I had a great stay the unit is brand new and extremely clean thank you for the stay and will definitely come again","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5590165,"review":"Xuru Stays offers exceptional customer service they’re always available, responsive, and truly go above and beyond. One of the best hosting experiences I’ve had! The place itself is spotless, beautifully maintained, and fully equipped with everything you might need. They pay great attention to the smallest details, which makes a huge difference. I would absolutely stay here again without hesitation.","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5590237,"review":"Great stay a bit far from the marina but everything is close in gouna, 100% recommend this place.","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5610597,"review":"thank you for support and help","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5626250,"review":"The apartment was super clean, beautifully decorated, and had all the amenities I needed for a comfortable stay. The interior was cozy yet modern, with attention to detail that made it feel like a real home away from home. The kitchen was well-equipped, the bathroom was spotless, and the bed was incredibly comfy – I slept very well every night\n\nCommunication with the host was also excellent. They were friendly, responsive, and made sure I had everything I needed throughout my stay. It really added to the whole experience.\n\nHonestly, I would 100% recommend this apartment to anyone planning a trip to El Gouna. Whether you’re going for a weekend getaway or a longer stay, this place is perfect. Can’t wait to come back again soon! .. thanks Xurus!!♥️♥️","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5634625,"review":"Great place, well maintained, great furniture & a beautiful pool","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5645017,"review":"Everything was perfect! Thank you","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z"},{"id":5667389,"review":"Everything was amazing","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5669361,"review":"It was a great stay and the team are very responsive.","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5716191,"review":"The place is vast and very comfy all around. It's all well equipped and well kept. The pools are amazing, but the neighborhood is still quite empty (so go there if you're looking to skip any noise and just chill )\n\nXuru Stays were proactive and breezy as usual. They always keep things smooth and professional. \n\nThank you guys. Looking forward to my next stay!","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5738910,"review":"Exceeded expectations, place is so great, the location is brilliant - we came for the wakepark so a short walk. The rest of el Gouna you need to drive too but cabs are affordable and there is parking if you rent your own car.","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5741679,"review":"Very good","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5768788,"review":"« Nous avons passé un excellent séjour dans ce chalet. Tout était parfait : propre, bien rangé et très bien équipé, il ne manquait rien. La propreté était vraiment irréprochable. De plus, l’hôte a été géniale et très réactive. Si c’était à refaire, nous reviendrions avec grand plaisir ! »","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5811488,"review":"The apartment in Kamaran is in a new and quiet community, with nice pools and no noise around, which made for a peaceful stay. The one-bedroom has good space and can sleep up to three with the sofa bed, which is wide and comfortable.\n\nThat said, the apartment itself feels like it could use more care. Some of the furniture is bulky, making the layout less practical — the dining table, for example, isn’t really accessible. On arrival, there were no basic kitchen essentials provided (no dish soap, sponge, or dishwasher — only a kitchen roll), which made it a bit inconvenient.\n\nWe also had issues with a broken faucet and a clogged bathroom drain. The company managing the property (Xuru) did respond, but it took two days for the drain to be fixed. While systematic, their approach feels more like box-ticking than really thinking about the guest experience.\n\nOverall, the apartment does the job for a short stay, but with a little more attention to detail and focus on comfort, it could be mu","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5819058,"review":"Thank you so much guys,\nEverything was clean and on point.\nIt won't be the last time for sure","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5849524,"review":"I had a great stay the unit is brand new and extremely clean thank you for the stay and will definitely come again thank you for xuru","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:48.000000Z"},{"id":5860217,"review":"As always, A nice Apartment to stay in. Thank you xuru","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5861718,"review":"Super cool everything and the host very kind and great!","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5892608,"review":"I really enjoyed my stay—the place was cozy and comfortable. The host was very responsive.","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5910578,"review":"Great host.. New Apartment, good value for money","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:03.000000Z"},{"id":5935372,"review":"Mooi en schoon appartement. Rustige omgeving en alles goed en snel bereikbaar met uber. Snel reagerende en vriendelijke guest relation.","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6090965,"review":"Nice","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:23.000000Z"},{"id":6102796,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6108425,"review":"They were super responsive and helpful! It was a great stay :)","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6112889,"review":"It was an amazing stay! Everything was so clean and tidy. The location is very close to everything","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6159017,"review":"Positive:\nL’emplacement le calme absolu\n\nNegative:\nLa douche qui se bouché sans cesse \nL’appartement était très très très sale à l’arrivé \nPas de communication précise sur l’accès à la ville de el gouna car besoin de Qr code pour les accès et non communiquer par l’agence \nJ’ai dû acheter tout le nécessaire pour nettoyer la maison (balai serpiere produit nettoyant)\nPas assez de vaisselle pour préparer des plats allant au four (plat à gratin etc) \nVaisselle médiocre \nTrès peux de verre et de tasse j’ai du en racheter","rental_id":234253,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}